    "title"            "PZRC Mod"
    "description"      "Standalone server-side toolkit for PZ B42 Multiplayer: starter kit crate, ration fridge, dynamic radio events, library, infinite generator, fuel pump refill, and a welcome note. All logic ships inside the mod — no manual file drops to ~/Zomboid/Lua/ required."

    "changenote"       "0.4.2 — Right-click on a non-owner's claimed vehicle now shows NO menu at all instead of greyed-out options. Implemented by wrapping ISWorldObjectContextMenu.createMenu and filtering inaccessible vehicles out of worldobjects before PZ builds the menu — vanilla createMenuEntries never sees them so no vehicle options get added. // 0.4.1 — Fixed nested-container loophole (bag-in-trunk). // 0.4.0 — Safe-zone vehicle-claim (sandbox EnableVehicleClaim, default OFF), damage protection, library Place Item blocked, FuelPump min 500, abandoned-vehicle event fixes."

